{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00018",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.1,
      "end_seconds": 4.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Doctor? Hi. I hope I've got the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.32,
      "end_seconds": 8.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.81,
      "end_seconds": 20.63,
      "duration_seconds": 10.82,
      "text": "Mainly a tight band-like headache. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.94,
      "end_seconds": 24.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.92,
      "end_seconds": 28.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "It's been going on for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.82,
      "end_seconds": 32.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.17,
      "end_seconds": 43.59,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "I'd say a couple of times a week. I notice it more with long hours on the computer and stress. It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.9,
      "end_seconds": 46.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.02,
      "end_seconds": 49.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "It usually comes with irritability."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.74,
      "end_seconds": 53.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.87,
      "end_seconds": 58.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.86,
      "end_seconds": 63.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "So, any vomiting or jaw pain when chewing at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.87,
      "end_seconds": 67.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "I haven't had vomiting or jaw pain when chewing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.48,
      "end_seconds": 72.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.77,
      "end_seconds": 77.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Thank you, um, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.02,
      "end_seconds": 81.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.42,
      "end_seconds": 84.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.5,
      "end_seconds": 88.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.27,
      "end_seconds": 102.26,
      "duration_seconds": 12.99,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.27,
      "end_seconds": 106.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.27,
      "end_seconds": 110.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Combiflam. I take it most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.92,
      "end_seconds": 113.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.78,
      "end_seconds": 128.97,
      "duration_seconds": 15.19,
      "text": "Uh, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.24,
      "end_seconds": 134.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.03,
      "end_seconds": 137.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.7,
      "end_seconds": 141.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.63,
      "end_seconds": 143.36,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.39,
      "end_seconds": 172.65,
      "duration_seconds": 15.26,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.14,
      "end_seconds": 177.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Uh, I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.47,
      "end_seconds": 193.56,
      "duration_seconds": 15.09,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.71,
      "end_seconds": 199.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Good, you know, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.34,
      "end_seconds": 220.33,
      "duration_seconds": 19.99,
      "text": "So, based on your history, it fits best with a tension-type headache. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a tight band-like headache for nearly five years, mild, and no jaw pain when chewing or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.41,
      "end_seconds": 223.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.79,
      "end_seconds": 229.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Right, is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.15,
      "end_seconds": 233.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.17,
      "end_seconds": 252.71,
      "duration_seconds": 18.54,
      "text": "I'm going to order an eye check, for headache and eye strain. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Let's use amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, for six weeks. That should help with headache prevention. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.03,
      "end_seconds": 254.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.72,
      "end_seconds": 268.79,
      "duration_seconds": 13.07,
      "text": "Painkillers on most days can actually make the headaches stick around. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. I'll also refer you to physiotherapy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.29,
      "end_seconds": 271.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.92,
      "end_seconds": 286.95,
      "duration_seconds": 14.03,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. I'd like to see you again in four weeks. Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.24,
      "end_seconds": 295.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "So, I take the amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night and come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.2,
      "end_seconds": 302.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.49,
      "end_seconds": 306.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "That's all, thank you for your time."
    }
  ]
}